{
  "_id": "4oXhPi877eT19iuY",
  "name": "武者的万能钥匙 Warrior's Passkey (BMT)",
  "type": "equipment",
  "system": {
    "source": {
      "custom": "",
      "book": "BMT",
      "page": "39",
      "license": "",
      "rules": "2014",
      "revision": 1
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>奇物，珍稀（需同调）</em></p><p>这把银色的万能钥匙摸起来很温暖。若你持握着钥匙形态的它，你便可以用一个动作从钥匙中施展法术<em> @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.VC9nFuUxF7yptXK5]{敲击术 Knock}</em>。</p><p><em><strong>转化钥匙Transforming the Key。</strong></em>持握钥匙期间，你可以用一个附赠动作将其转变为一把魔法长剑。你熟练于这把剑，并且你用它进行的攻击检定和伤害掷骰获得+1加值。命中目标时，剑会造成[[/damage 1d10 type=force]]伤害。该物品的剑形态持续到你不再持握它或者你用一个附赠动作将其恢复到钥匙形态为止。如果你在该物品处于剑形态时结束对该物品的同调，它会自动恢复到钥匙形态。</p><p>This silver skeleton key is warm to the touch. While holding the key in its key form, you can use an action to cast the @spell[Knock] spell from the key.</p><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Transforming the Key\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Transforming the Key.</span> While holding the key, you can use a bonus action to transform it into a magic longsword. You are considered proficient with the sword, and you have a +1 bonus to attack and damage rolls made with it. On a hit, the sword deals [[/damage 1d10 type=force]] damage. The item remains in its sword form until it leaves your grasp or you use another bonus action to revert it to its key form.</p><p>If you end your attunement to the item while it's in its sword form, it automatically reverts to its key form.</p></div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
